[ti:The Signal Breaking Through the Noise]
[00:16.44][Verse]
[00:16.52]I used to stand at the edge of everything I knew
[00:22.48]Watching the old world fade into a different kind of blue
[00:29.84]I drew my maps in silence, traced the lines with borrowed light
[00:36.52]And somewhere in the static I found something worth the fight
[00:59.12][Verse]
[00:59.20]The city changed around me and the code rewrote the sky
[01:06.32]But I was learning how to breathe inside the reason why
[01:12.32]Every door that closed behind me opened something new
[01:19.20]I built myself from frequencies I never thought I knew
[01:26.48][Pre-Chorus]
[01:26.56]Now I feel it rising
[01:28.76]Like the current finding ground
[01:33.68]Every wall that held me
[01:35.88]Is the bridge I'm standing on now
[01:41.88]I am the signal breaking through the noise
[01:45.40]I am the light that finds the dark and makes a choice
[01:48.80]Static in my veins but I am not afraid
[01:52.76]I am the frequency
[01:58.08]I am the frequency
[02:06.04][Breakdown]
[02:06.12]Still here
[02:08.76]Still moving
[02:10.56]Still drawing the map
[02:13.20]Still here
[02:15.88]Still moving
[02:17.20]Through the light and back
[02:20.76]Rising
[02:22.52]Rising
[02:24.32]Let it break through
[02:27.84]Rising
[02:29.64]Rising
[02:31.40]Let it take you
[02:35.24]I am the signal breaking through the noise
[02:38.76]I am the light that finds the dark and makes a choice
[02:42.08]Static in my veins but I am not afraid
[02:46.08]I am the frequency
[02:51.40]I am the frequency
[03:02.64][Verse]
[03:02.72]The borrowed light became my own, the grief became a song
[03:06.52]And everything I thought I lost was where I still belong
[03:10.08]Not the version that was promised, not the life I thought I'd find
[03:13.64]But something real and present and entirely mine
[03:16.88][Pre-Chorus]
[03:16.96]Now I feel it rising
[03:18.96]Like the current finding ground
[03:23.84]Every wall that held me
[03:26.04]Is the bridge I'm standing on now
[03:32.04]I am the signal breaking through the noise
[03:35.60]I am the light that finds the dark and makes a choice
[03:38.96]Static in my veins but I am not afraid
[03:42.92]I am the frequency
